Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 20:38:01 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 21/22] POC-11e: wild packs - 2-3 wild Pokemon on the grid, BN
 virus style

Foe context swap (sB.f[SIDE_ENEMY] = the selected foe), packs only from standard
grass/water encounters, area hits strike every foe, BN6 multi-delete scoring,
catching once one is left. One foe = the old battle (regression logs identical).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
